### Accounts
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/accounts

### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### Successful transfer
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccountNumber": "ACC-1001",
  "destinationAccountNumber": "ACC-1002",
  "amount": "75.00",
  "currency": "USD",
  "idempotencyKey": "demo-transfer-001"
}

### Loan creation
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "borrowerAccountNumber": "ACC-1001",
  "principal": "1200.00",
  "currency": "USD",
  "annualInterestRate": "12.00",
  "termMonths": 12
}

### Loan schedule
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/loans/LN-00000000/schedule

### Transfer lookup
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/transfers/TRF-00000000
